### 1. REST Countries – details about Bulgaria
GET https://restcountries.com/v2/name/Bulgaria

### 2. GitHub: Labels Issue – first issue of test-nakov-repo
GET https://api.github.com/repos/testnakov/test-nakov-repo/issues/1

### 3. GitHub: Create Issue (GitHub no longer accepts passwords – use a personal access token)
POST https://api.github.com/repos/testnakov/test-nakov-repo/issues
Authorization: Basic {{username}}:{{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Found a bug",
  "body": "I'm having a problem with this."
}
